gy Market Size \u0026 Outlook\",\"description\":\"The wearable technology market in the United States is expected to reach a projected revenue of US$ 56,454.7 million by 2033. A compound annual growth rate of 10.8% is expected of the United States wearable technology market from 2026 to 2033.\",\"temporalCoverage\":\"2025/2033\",\"creator\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Grand View Research\",\"url\":\"https://www.grandviewresearch.com/horizon\"},\"license\":\"https://www.grandviewresearch.com/horizon/info/terms-of-use\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":false,\"variableMeasured\":[{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Revenue 2025\",\"value\":\"USD 25,165.5 million\",\"unitText\":\"USD million\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Estimate 2026\",\"value\":\"USD 27,611.2 million\",\"unitText\":\"USD million\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Forecast 2033\",\"value\":\"USD 56,454.7 million\",\"unitText\":\"USD million\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"CAGR 2026 - 2033\",\"value\":\"10.8%\",\"unitText\":\"%\"}]}5:[[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"httpEquiv\":\"X-UA-Compatible\",\"content\":\"IE=edge\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1c\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1d\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1e\"}}],\"$L1f\"]\nd:null\n"])</script><script type="51573723b43608c262384608-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"12:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"The United States Wearable Technology Market Outlook, 2033\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"The wearable technology market in the United States is expected to reach a projected revenue of US$ 56,454.7 million by 2033. A compound annual growth rate of 10.8% is expected of the United States wearable technology market from 2026 to 2033.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",