the United States wearable technology market from 2026 to 2033.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://www.grandviewresearch.com/horizon/featured_og_regional/wearable-technology-market-united-states.webp\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"https://cdn.grandviewresearch.online/horizon/images/horizon_ico.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",\"19\",{}]]\n"])</script><script type="51573723b43608c262384608-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"21:I[827055,[\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/0zhbw0syep9h_.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/3_nwh7t9td19l.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/2_qamwxz8x7oi.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/05tbhcuewqul_.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/1n_dbdbadkfla.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/33y1_t-ordgsz.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/25aq9elj221h8.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/0aq-efd8k7749.js\"],\"default\"]\n22:T809,"])</script><script type="51573723b43608c262384608-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003ch2\u003eU.S. wearable technology market highlights\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe U.S. wearable technology market generated a revenue of USD 25,165.5 million in 2025 and is expected to reach USD 56,454.7 million by 2033.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe U.S. market is expected to grow at a CAGR of 10.8% from 2026 to 2033.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn terms of segment, wrist-wear was the largest revenue generating product in 2025.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrist-Wear is the most lucrative product segment registering the fastest growth during the forecast period.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWearable technology market data book summary\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket revenue in 2025\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eUSD 25,165.5 million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket revenue in 2033\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eUSD 56,454.7 million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGrowth rate\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e10.8% (CAGR from 2026 to 2033)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eLargest segment\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWrist-wear\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eFastest growing segment\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWrist-Wear\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eHistorical data\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2021 - 2024\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eBase year\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2025\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eForecast period\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2026 - 2033\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eQuantitative units\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRevenue in USD million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket segmentation\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eEye-Wear \u0026amp; Head-Wear, Neck-Wear, Foot-Wear, Body-wear, Wrist-Wear, Other Product\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eKey market players worldwide\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eAlphabet Inc Class A, Samsung Electronics Co Ltd, Sony Group Corp, Huawei Technologies, Apple Inc, Xiaomi Corp Class B, Adidas AG, Nike Inc Class B, Fitbit, Garmin Ltd\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eOther key industry trends\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul class=\"second_ul\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn terms of revenue, U.S. accounted for 27.1% of the global wearable technology market in 2025.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCountry-wise, U.S. is expected to lead the global market in terms of revenue in 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn North America, U.S. wearable technology market is projected to lead the regional market in terms of revenue in 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eU.S. is the fastest growing regional market in North America and is projected to reach USD 56,454.7 million by 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr\u003e"])</script><script type="51573723b43608c262384608-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"23:T588,"])</script><script type="51573723b43608c262384608-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"{\"header\": [\"Product\", 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026, 2027, 2028, 2029, 2030, 2031, 2032, 2033, \"CAGR\"], \"data\": [[\"Eye-Wear \u0026 Head-Wear\", \"3842.32\", \"4515.12\", \"5292.21\", \"6188.22\", \"6817.69\", \"7552.84\", \"8405.83\", \"9388.20\", \"10498.97\", \"11748.37\", \"13149.84\", \"14720.79\", \"16481.55\", \"11.79%\"], [\"Neck-Wear\", \"475.13\", \"554.98\", \"646.65\", \"751.72\", \"823.43\", \"907.05\", \"1003.84\", \"1114.97\", \"1240.09\", \"1380.21\", \"1536.66\", \"1711.23\", \"1906.01\", \"11.19%\"], [\"Foot-Wear\", \"1556.70\", \"1750.92\", \"1962.24\", \"2191.25\", \"2302.64\", \"2429.78\", \"2571.93\", \"2727.56\", \"2891.21\", \"3060.58\", \"3233.73\", \"3409.07\", \"3584.87\", \"5.71%\"], [\"Body-wear\", \"832.21\", \"898.51\", \"961.91\", \"1020.17\", \"1010.93\", \"997.16\", \"975.72\", \"942.86\", \"1005.13\", \"1111.97\", \"1200.01\", \"1302.81\", \"1414.06\", \"5.12%\"], [\"Wrist-Wear\", \"6591.27\", \"7766.34\", \"9127.04\", \"10699.88\", \"11818.07\", \"13124.78\", \"14642.37\", \"16392.31\", \"18374.27\", \"20607.50\", \"23117.07\", \"25935.10\", \"29099.17\", \"12.05%\"], [\"Other Product\", \"1457.84\", \"1680.02\", \"1931.16\", \"2214.53\", \"2392.72\", \"2599.57\", \"2837.31\", \"3107.70\", \"3296.32\", \"3450.54\", \"3631.19\", \"3802.64\", \"3969.04\", \"6.23%\"], [\"Total\", \"14755.47\", \"17165.89\", \"19921.21\", \"23065.77\", \"25165.48\", \"27611.18\", \"30437.00\", \"33673.60\", \"37305.99\", \"41359.17\", \"45868.50\", \"50881.64\", \"56454.70\", \"10.76%\"]], \"tableName\": \"U.S. wearable technology market statistics, by product, 20